Web source (THE spec): web/src/components/maps/AnimatedMarker.tsx
  Thin Leaflet surface: a <Marker> whose DivIcon is a pulsing CSS circle + inner tinted
  circle (white border + glow) optionally rotated by `heading`; on every position/heading/
  color change it setLatLng + setIcon, and `panTo(target)` ONLY when the marker leaves the
  current map bounds (keep-in-view, zoom preserved). Props: position[lat,lng], heading?,
  color? (default #00b4d8). Data source: useMap (the live map context).

