Wiring (P4-core normally owns directory registration; minimal + listed here, no silent drift):
  ~ project.yml      add "TeslaSync/shared-surfaces" to TeslaSync (iOS) + TeslaSync-macOS app
                     target sources (exclude "*Tests.swift"); add AnimatedMarker.Tests.swift to
                     TeslaSyncTests + TeslaSync-macOSTests. ALSO add the missing "*Tests.swift"
                     exclude to dashboard-widgets + feature-views in both app targets (see
                     PRE-EXISTING DEFECTS below).
  ~ .swiftlint.yml   add "TeslaSync/shared-surfaces" to `included` so the surface is linted.
  ~ Localization/Localizable.xcstrings  +8 i18n keys (en translated; ar/he needs_review per repo
                     convention): surface.animatedMarker.{title,error,loading,empty.title,
                     empty.message,a11y.map,a11y.vehicle,a11y.refresh}. Reused in-catalog
                     widget.freshness.{live,stale,offline,error} for the freshness chip.

Architecture parity:
  - Data source useMap is bound through the P1/S8 state-holder layer: AnimatedMarkerView owns
    @Observable AnimatedMarkerModel, which projects the injected AnimatedMarkerDataSource result
    into the shared-facade LoadableState and layers freshness (stale/offline) on top. NO HTTP in
    the view. Production wires a facade/live-position source at the composition root; tests/previews
    inject an in-memory source.
  - Keep-in-view behaviour reproduced 1:1: AnimatedMarkerCamera.recenteredRegion recentres the
    MapCameraPosition on the vehicle only when it leaves the visible region, preserving the span
    (zoom) -- the native analogue of Leaflet getBounds().contains + panTo.
  - Marker reproduced: pulsing tinted circle (opacity 0.3, scale/opacity pulse) + inner tinted
    circle (white border + glow) + heading arrow rotated by `heading`; arbitrary hex color honored
    with the #00b4d8 default; Reduce Motion honored.
  - States reproduced: loading (skeleton) / empty ("No live position") / error (TSQueryError +
    retry) / stale (freshness chip + refresh) / offline (cached + offline chip) / content (live map).
  - i18n: every string is a P1/S10 LocalizedStringKey; no English literals in code.
  - Diagnostics: model emits view.opened with slug "AnimatedMarker" once on appear (P1/S11),
    via an injectable @Sendable seam (osLog default). No coordinate/PII logged.
  - Accessibility: header isHeader trait; map labelled; marker annotation titled; refresh labelled;
    freshness chip combined label; pin accessibilityHidden; reduce-motion honored on pulse + camera.

